WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.280
<b>Let's go, one, two, three, four,</b>

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.220
<b>fly!</b>

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.190
<b>Fly!</b>

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.990
<b>"Kenzaki Makoto, the idol."</b>

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.630
<b>"Her debut hit sold a million copies in one week."</b>

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.400
<b>"Right now, she's on the fast track to stardom."</b>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.170
<b>Could this girl really be Cure Sword?</b>

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:23.870
<b>Yes.</b>

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.640
<b>On the day that Cure Sword appeared in Clover Tower,</b>

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:32.580
<b>the number of people that went to and from the viewing platform differed.</b>

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:39.280
<b>Makoto and her manager left no traces of ever leaving.</b>

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.020
<b>But that's just...</b>

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.890
<b>No, there is more.</b>

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:47.460
<b>We have her fingerprints, shoe size, and DNA retrieved from her hair.</b>

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.430
<b>Everything matches.</b>

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.700
<b>Did you hire a forensics team?</b>

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.970
<b>Makopi is Cure Sword!</b>

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:57.740
<b>An idol <i>and</i> a Precure...</b>

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:00.040
<b>and she's amazing at both to boot!</b>

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.940
<b>There's no time to lose!</b>

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:04.810
<b>Hey, where are you going?</b>

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:06.010
<b>Isn't it obvious?</b>

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.950
<b>I'm gonna see Makopi and talk to her again!</b>

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:10.950
<b>Do you even know where she is?</b>

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.690
<b>I mean, we're talking about a celebrity.</b>

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:18.120
<b>It's not going to be that easy to see her.</b>

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:23.830
<b>In that case, please leave the matter to me.</b>

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:36.210
<b>Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!</b>

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:38.680
<b>The world is like a merry-go-round</b>

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:41.550
<b>Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1</b>

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:43.580
<b>Every day it sparkles</b>

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.290
<b>Dokidoki Precure</b>

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:54.160
<b>I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before</b>

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:59.830
<b>My heart races and I greet the scenery around me</b>

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.470
<b>The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day</b>

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.910
<b>Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed</b>

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:16.620
<b>If your friends are in trouble</b>

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:25.490
<b>isn't it normal to help them?</b>

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.160
<b>Happy lucky Precure</b>

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.560
<b>Only Precure makes my heart pound</b>

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.400
<b>Our happy love will change the world</b>

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:35.200
<b>What's more than just cute</b>

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.070
<b>is our promise between girls</b>

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:45.110
<b>I will fight for you and believe in you</b>

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:51.020
<b>Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure</b>

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.760
<b>There's a fourth Precure?</b>

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.990
<b>I tell ya, they just keep coming.</b>

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.460
<b>There's gonna be a hundred of 'em soon enough.</b>

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.960
<b>Do something before it comes to that.</b>

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.670
<b>Why're you pushing it on me?</b>

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:11.140
