<b>No Way!

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:39.970
<b>It seems that Makoto is being filmed here for a music program.</b>

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:41.170
<b>A TV station?</b>

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.040
<b>How do we get inside?</b>

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.110
<b>W-Wait, Alice!</b>

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:53.650
<b>Welcome.</b>

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:54.850
<b>Good afternoon.</b>

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.120
<b>Oh, we can just walk in.</b>

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:01.920
<b>Good afternoon!</b>

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.120
<b>Please stop!</b>

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:06.060
<b>This area is restricted from people without business!</b>

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.290
<b>They are fine.</b>

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:11.230
<b>Those girls are my friends, after all.</b>

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.060
<b>Right!</b>

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:13.770
<b>My apologies!</b>

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.130
<b>What was with that?</b>

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:19.600
<b>This is one of the companies my father manages.</b>

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.440
<b>Yotsuba TV...</b>

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.940
<b>Yotsuba TV</b>

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.940
<b>Yotsuba TV</b>

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:26.010
<b>Guess we should have noticed the name...</b>

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.450
<b>This song...</b>

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:37.860
<b>One, two, three, four, fly!</b>

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:42.230
<b>Fly!</b>

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:44.560
<b>Okay!</b>

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.030
<b>Good work!</b>

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.770
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.200
<b>Good luck on the show!</b>

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.450
<b>I-It's Makopi!</b>

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:04.220
<b>She's quite a splendid lady.</b>

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.050
<b>Don't get starstruck now!</b>

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.890
<b>We came to find out who she is.</b>

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.350
<b>Right.</b>

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.200
<b>So, what's the next plan?</b>

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:19.900
<b>There is no plan.</b>

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.340
<b>All right, onto the next rehearsal!</b>

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:30.240
<b>Do not worry.</b>

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:32.980
<b>I am certain Mana will find a way.</b>

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:39.750
<b>Ma-Mana!</b>

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:41.250
<b>Mana!</b>

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:42.790
<b>Ma—</b>

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.090
<b>I'm sorry I'm sorry I'm sorry!</b>

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.560
Waiting Room 23

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.560
Music Xanadu!

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.560
Kenzaki Makoto

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:51.560
<b>What's next on our schedule?</b>

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.500
<b>The fashion magazine photo shoot is in an hour.</b>

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:57.400
<b>The radio guest appearance is after that.</b>

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:00.670
<b>You have five interviews to give on the trains there.</b>

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.870
<b>Tonight, a meeting about the album.</b>

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:07.010
<b>Make sure to give the fan club an update today.</b>

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:07.850
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.320
<b>Sign those while you have time.</b>

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:12.780
<b>I see. I'll start right away.</b>

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.920
<b>It's been a bit too busy lately.</b>

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:17.490
<b>I'm fine.</b>

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:20.130
<b>It's all for the people who wait for my songs.</b>

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:24.260
<b>That's right.</b>

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.400
<b>I'll bring a drink.</b>

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:32.240
<b>I don't have the time to be tired.</b>

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.670
<b>What is it?</b>

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.980
<b>Did you forget your wallet?</b>

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.380
<b>Be careful not to 
forget your belongings.</b>

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.380
<b>Excuse me!</b>

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.750
<b>It's you again!</b>

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.080
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.950
<b>I'm Cure Heart!</b>

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.560
<b>Please be my ally!</b>

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:51.660
<b>Huh?</b>

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:55.230
<b>I've gotten a lot more experience since we last met!</b>

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.060
<b>There are three of us now!</b>

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:01.130
<b>I really admire how you can be so cute,</b>

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:04.940
<b>but still sing so powerfully!</b>

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.740
<b>And being a Precure on top of it?</b>

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.140
<b>It makes my heart race!</b>

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.340
<b>If you join with us,</b>

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.010
<b>we'd be a hundred...</b>

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.280
<b>no, a thousand times stronger!</b>

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:18.380
<b>Huh?</b>

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.590
<b>Um...</b>

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:25.220
<b>you <i>are</i> Cure Sword, right? {Good time to ask that question, yes.}</b>

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:26.590
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.230
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.900
<b>Do you understand where you are?</b>

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.360
<b>A TV station!</b>

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.000
<b>We're professionals!</b>

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.400
<b>We air dreams right into peoples' living rooms! {I hope not even Toei believes this.}</b>

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:41.670
<b>This is no place to stomp around as you please!</b>

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.610
<b>What's the commotion?</b>

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.650
<b>It's you...</b>

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:50.850
<b>There you are!</b>

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:54.250
<b>I figured you'd come to Makoto's waiting room.</b>

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:57.620
<b>I have an important performance soon.</b>

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.430
<b>Could you please leave?</b>

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:05.500
<b>Mana, let's go.</b>

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.510
<b>What a surprise.</b>

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.540
<b>I didn't think they'd let themselves in.</b>

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.780
<b>I don't trust that girl.</b>

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:20.010
<b>Perhaps.</b>

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:22.680
<b>But I felt her passion for you.</b>

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:29.320
<b>Really, what were you thinking?</b>

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.520
<b>You barged in alone with no plan,</b>

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:34.730
<b>and just did everything on a whim.</b>

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:36.430
<b>You should think more next time...</b>

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:39.900
<b>Rikka, please do not be so harsh.</b>

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:42.730
<b>Mana knows what she did was wrong.</b>

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:44.700
<b>I...</b>

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:49.240
<b>always thought I could befriend anyone with a handshake.</b>

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.840
<b>Especially a fellow Precure.</b>

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.880
<b>I was positive we'd be great friends.</b>

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.950
<b>But I forgot something important.</b>

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.120
<b>To be friends...</b>

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:04.220
<b>you have to understand each other's feelings!</b>

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:09.260
<b>Makopi's an idol, so singing is important to her,</b>

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:12.100
<b>but I still stomped on her passion.</b>

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:14.500
<b>Mana...</b>

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.600
<b>It seems you understand.</b>

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:20.270
<b>Kenzaki Makoto is always passionate.</b>

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:23.040
<b>That's why her songs echo in the heart.</b>

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.510
<b>You're...</b>

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.940
<b>the manager!</b>

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:42.990
<b>Filming</b>

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:42.990
<b>Filming</b>

